#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/ContentSecurityPolicy/BlockingAlgorithms.cpp (lines 1-396).
#       Region r28 ported the inline and <base> checks of the file for phase 1
#       (blocking_algorithms_2); region p2e ported the rest.
